# 📊 Customer Churn Analytics & Retention Dashboard

An interactive **Power BI** and **SQL** analytics solution designed to analyze customer attrition, identify high-risk churn segments, and evaluate revenue impacts for targeted retention strategies.

---

## 📌 Business Overview & Objective
Acquiring new customers costs significantly more than retaining existing ones. Understanding why customers churn and identifying early indicators of churn allows business teams to take proactive retention measures.

### Key Objectives:
- Measure overall customer churn rate and track high-risk customer segments.
- Analyze key churn drivers including contract types, tenure, payment methods, and monthly charges.
- Provide actionable insights for marketing and customer success teams to reduce revenue leakage.

---

## 📊 Key Metrics & Insights
- **Overall Churn Rate:** Identified key customer cohorts driving recurring churn.
- **Contract Impact:** Month-to-month contract holders show significantly higher churn risk compared to long-term plans.
- **Tenure Patterns:** First 12 months represent the highest risk window for customer drop-off.
- **Payment Method Analysis:** Electronic check users exhibit higher churn tendencies compared to automated payment methods.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack & Tools Used
- **Business Intelligence:** Power BI Desktop
- **Database & Data Cleaning:** SQL / Excel
- **Data Modeling:** DAX (Data Analysis Expressions)
- **Visuals:** Executive KPI Cards, Decomposition Trees, Churn Breakdowns
